    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">use our eyes, throw our hands overboard</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;â€œWelcome to my birthday &lt;em&gt;adventure!&lt;/em&gt;â€ Sea Hawk says.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;â€œYouâ€™re not allowed to call it that!â€ A voice comes from below deck, sounding alarmingly close. â€œYour â€˜adventuresâ€™ end in &lt;em&gt;arson&lt;/em&gt;. This is a birthday &lt;em&gt;party&lt;/em&gt;, remember?â€&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
